  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Board of Revenue Department Bihar/ Uttar Pradesh are Providing the Online Certification Verification for Land Record, Khasra, Khatauni, Land Map, Bhu Naksha Online Check and Verification Download Now. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Those All The Interested People Checking UP Land Details all the information related to the Dakhil Kharij, Registration is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%; height: 670px;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Board of Revenue ,Uttar Pradesh</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Dakhil Kharij, Registration Online 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Start Date For Verification Process – <strong>July 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Check Online Verification – <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>As Per Schedule</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>There is No Application Fees for Checking or Verification for Khasra, Khatauni, Bhulekh, Bhunaksha and other Land Records</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Check your Land Record</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">UP Khasara, Khatauni, Bhunaksha, Land Map and More Online Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 1.71233%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Verify Bhulekh</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>For checking or verifying the online certificate candidates have to go to the important link provided below in the link section.</li>\n<li>After getting the link click on the verification link either Server I or Old Server II</li>\n<li>Now your land distinct or the land distinct you want to search (For Example- Agra, Allahabad, Firozabad, Kanpur, Varanasi etc).</li>\n<li>Enter or choose the Tehsil Name in the provided space.</li>\n<li>Enter the village/ area Name in the box provided.</li>\n<li>At last enter your Khasara Number in the box.</li>\n<li>Finally you will be able to verify the land record and other details regarding the land.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"tex